(a) Upon completion of construction, all privately owned infrastructure, including but not limited to road pavement, drive aisles, easements, ponds, stop signs, street name signs, lighting, etc., shall be maintained in good working order with the standards of their approval for the public's health, safety, and welfare in perpetuity for the life of such development.
